cial performance across the Company that drove higher incentive payments and some cost savings that we did realize in Rail North America maintenance we had planned for the SG&A line, instead they showed up in the operating cost line.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/01/23/gatx-corp-gatx-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GATX 2020 Q1","e":"gatx","d":"2020-05-04","l":"pricing_power","r":"analyst","s":"Bascome Majors","x":"If I could just ask one more before passing it on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/gatx-corp-gatx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GATX 2020 Q1","e":"gatx","d":"2020-05-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Ellman","x":"Similar to our rail business, RRPF's contracts do not allow for cancellations when they get a restructuring request they look at them on a case-by-case basis, taking full advantage of contractual rights and looking for opportunities to enhance the customer relationship without lots of economic…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/05/04/gatx-corp-gatx-q1-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GATX 2020 Q2","e":"gatx","d":"2020-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Thomas A. Ellman","x":"In the wake of COVID, we implemented certain cost reduction measures and eliminated discretionary spending in areas like hiring, consulting, travel and entertainment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/21/gatx-corp-gatx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GATX 2020 Q2","e":"gatx","d":"2020-07-21","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Robert C. Lyons","x":"We had approximately 15 requests on a customer base of 850 for some type of restructuring or deferral.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/07/21/gatx-corp-gatx-q2-2020-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"GATX 2020 Q4","e":"gatx","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian A. Kenney","x":"As an essential industry in North America, our maintenance employees showed up for work continuously from day one and helped us realize the cost savings of more fully utilizing our own network.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/gatx-corp-gatx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GATX 2020 Q4","e":"gatx","d":"2021-01-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Brian A. Kenney","x":"That's actually been a good news story as we've outperformed our expectations during the last two years by aggressively moving more work from those third-party facilities into our own network and realizing the associated cost savings.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/28/gatx-corp-gatx-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GATX 2021 Q2","e":"gatx","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Shari Hellerman","x":"And then, I'll turn it over to Brian for additional comments on our performance and our decision to raise guidance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/gatx-corporation-gatx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"GATX 2021 Q2","e":"gatx","d":"2021-07-20","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Paul Titterton","x":"For the LPI, we're reiterating the guidance we provided previously, which is a range from negative 15% to a negative 5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/gatx-corporation-gatx-q2-2021-earnings-call-transc/"},{"c":"GATX 2025 Q3","e":"gatx","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Shari Hellerman","x":"While tariff and macro uncertainties have affected customers who use the most economically sensitive car types, demand for the large majority of car types in our fleet is holding up well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/10/21/gatx-gatx-q3-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"GATX 2025 Q3","e":"gatx","d":"2025-10-21","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Robert C. Lyons","x":"Of course, tariffs are genera